; KammInletH_10PlatformPlus6InletLayers_10mmHorizontalLines_16Layers
; P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG. Updated in place; 16 physical layers, final height 0.960 mm.
; Every layer: original left structure, bottom left pair, top left pair,
; then original right structure, bottom right pair, top right pair.
; Eight 10 mm horizontal roads per layer, 128 total; nominal width 0.300 mm, height 0.060 mm.
; Each pair has 0.150 mm centerline pitch; added copies offset outward (bottom -Y, top +Y).
; Original horizontal endpoints retained; 0.500 mm centerline gap to platform outer verticals.
; Horizontal flow 1.4 baked into E once; layer 1 at 5 mm/s, layers 2-16 at 25 mm/s.
; Structural and inlet paths/settings retained; inlet source layers 1-6 only, no roof.
; Base: 255 C nozzle / 70 C bed / K0.55. Inlet stage: 245 C / 70 C / K0.05.
; Retracted transfers outside the structure; lifts >=0.400 mm above current nominal layer.
; One startup/shutdown; thermal transition wait parked at X20 Y220 Z5.
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
M201 X20000 Y20000 Z500 E5000
M203 X500 Y500 Z20 E30
M204 P20000 R5000 T20000
M205 X9.00 Y9.00 Z3.00 E2.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M106 S0
